'''Filibuster Cat X''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] implemented in [[Version 8.3 Update|Version 8.3]] and is unlocked by beating the [[Filibuster Invasion (Cats of the Cosmos)|Filibuster Invasion]] in [[Cats of the Cosmos]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 12.0 Update|Version 12.0]] improves his health, attack power and attack rate, adds [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] targeting as well as gaining immunity to Curse and [[Surge Attack|Surge]] effects. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 14.7 Update|Version 14.7]].

