==Trivia==
*Similarly to how [[Evangelist Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Evangelist Cat]] resembles [[wikia:dragonball:Frieza|Frieza]] from ''[[wikia:dragonball:Dragon Ball Z|Dragon Ball Z]]'', Filibuster Cat X resembles Frieza's cybernetic "Mecha Frieza" form.
*Metafilibuster may be a reference to the [[wikia:dragonball:Meta-Cooler|Meta-Coolers]] introduced in ''[[wikia:dragonball:Dragon Ball Z: The Return of Cooler|Dragon Ball Z: The Return of Cooler]]'', his coloration specifically being based off of Golden Meta-Cooler. This is supported by how the [[Metafilibuster (Enemy)|enemy Metafilibuster]]'s Japanese description says that his power can change the world and how his first stage's English name is [[A Whole New World]], potentially referencing Meta-Cooler's role as one of the [[wikia:dragonball:Universe Creation Planners|Universe Creation Planners]].
*Metafilibuster's knockback animation has the hologram glitch slightly. He shares this behavior with his enemy counterpart.
*Filibuster Cat X has the longest attack foreswing of all [[Cat Units]].
*Unlike the original [[Evangelist Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Filibuster Cat]], who freezes almost all enemy types, this unit can only freeze [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] and eventually [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] enemies.
*For some reason, Filibuster Cat Y keeps most of his parts mechanized, except for his tail.

